N.330="comment"*225x21*57x41<M>
C="{\\rtf1\\ansi\\ansicpg1252\\deff0\\deflang1033{\\fonttbl{\\f0\\fnil\\fcharset0 Arial;}}
\\viewkind4\\uc1\\pard\\fs18 specific heat (btu/(lb*degF)\\par
aluminum = .215\\par
copper .0923\\par
\\par
Weight of Evaporator = 30 LB\\par
\\par
Q = M*Cp*deltaT\\par
deltaT = tFinal - tInitial\\par
Q = -48000 BTU/hr  for a 4 ton ac\\par
Q = 100000 BTU/hr for the furnace in the 4 ton ac\\par
\\par
Cooling:\\par
The coil temp goes from approx 71 to 55 degF (16degF deltaT)\\par
-48000 = M*Cp*(55-71)\\par
M*Cp = 3000\\par
\\par
tFinal = (Q/ (M*Cp)) + tInitial\\par
\\par
\\par
\\par
}
"
